# Land the vehicle and disarm. This is the only land command.
#
# Accepted from any state while the vehicle is armed or a takeoff is in progress, and not
# already landing: it preempts takeoff, return home and missions. A takeoff that has not yet
# requested arm is simply cancelled and the goal succeeds at once, back in IDLE. Landing is
# committed once accepted: cancel requests are rejected. Succeeds once PX4 reports disarmed.
# The emergency kill switch is the RC controller's, not this action.
---
bool success
string message
---
string state
bool armed
float32 elapsed_s
